<title>UK: FHLMC sets $105 million November 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>FHLMC sets $105 million November 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Tokyo-Mitsubishi International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL HOME LOAN MORTGAGE CORPORATION</p>
<p> AMT    $105 MLN	COUPON     6.60	MATURITY    30.NOV.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  L-28.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.125     PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NOTES    L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
